# Windsurf Cascade Rules for Valence UI

Valence UI is an Angular 19+ design system and component library.

## Guidelines
- Always use standalone components from `valence-ui`.
- Never write ad-hoc CSS for layout: use `val-flex`, `val-grid`, `val-m-*`, `val-p-*`, `val-text-*`.
- Global styles import: `@use 'valence-ui/styles/main.scss';` in `styles.scss`.
- Use `ButtonComponent` (`<button val-button variant="...">`).
- Wrap inputs with `FormFieldComponent` (`<val-form-field>`).
- Inject `ToastService` and `ConfirmService` for alerts and dialog prompts.
